'''Gothic''' is an [[Uncommon Weapons|uncommon]] knife that was originally obtainable by unboxing it from the [[2021 Halloween Box|Halloween Box]] during the [[Halloween Event 2021|2021 Halloween Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

== Appearance ==
Its blade features a black shade with a shiny silver gothic pattern to its left, dividing it from the deep red edge. The guard is silver, and the handle is solid black.

== Trivia ==
* It has a [https://murder-mystery-2.fandom.com/wiki/Gothic_(Gun) partner gun] under the same name.
*It was designed by [[IDontHaveAUse]].

